// of the function is checked as if so written.
// ERROR: error[conv.mode_order]: a parameter's mode goes after the colon: 'x: inout i64', not 'inout x: i64'
// ERROR: --old 'inout x: i64' --new 'x: inout i64'
// ERROR: a parameter's mode goes after the colon: 'v: sink Vec<i64>', not 'sink v: Vec<i64>'
// ERROR: a parameter's mode goes after the colon: 'y: i64', not 'let y: i64'
